# Keep the build context lean + safe. Critically: never copy the host's node_modules over the container's
# fresh install (host binaries — esbuild/vite — are built for the host OS and break in Linux), and never
# bake .env secrets into the image.
#
# `scripts/` is deliberately NOT ignored: `npm run build` ends with scripts/prerender-landing.tsx (bakes
# the landing page into dist/index.html), so excluding it made every Docker build die on
# ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND right after vite finished. Reproduced with the exact ignore list in a scratch copy.
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.local
.git
.gitignore
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
